Neovim Tutor: 06 MACROS & REGISTERS

Goal
  Record, replay, and use registers.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 1: Macros
  q{a-z}  start recording into register
  q       stop recording
  @{a-z}  play macro
  @@      repeat last macro

Practice:
  - Record a macro in register a that changes a word.
  - Use @a to replay it on several lines.

------------------------------------------------------------
Lesson 2: Registers
  "0   last yank
  ""   unnamed register
  "+   system clipboard (if enabled)

Practice:
  - Yank a line, then paste from register 0 with "0p.

End of lesson 06.
